<title>USA: Pioneer Financial Services Inc Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Financial Services Inc Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.63		    $0.32</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.52		    $0.30</p>
<p> Net			  7,269		    3,316</p>
<p> Revs		     226,329		  201,743</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	11,544		    8,865</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	16,177		   12,649</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1995 results after $3,473,000 in bond conversion expenses.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 results after $123,000 in net realized investment gains vs $317,000 a year ago. Q3 1996 net operating income $0.62 a primary share ($0.51 diluted) vs $0.68 ($0.55).</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.78		    $1.74</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.48		    $1.25</p>
<p> Net			 20,024		   13,631</p>
<p> Revs		     643,949		  586,014</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	10,940		    7,078</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	15,189		   12,623</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 results include $636,000 in net realized investment gains vs $1,265,000.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 also after $295,000 in preferred stock redemption charges. Nine-month 1995 includes $3,473,000 in bond conversion expenses.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 net operating income $1.75 a primary share ($1.46 diluted) vs $2.05 ($1.42 diluted).</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
